00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:01.970
<i>Hell. Pandemonium.</i>

00:01:59.780 --> 00:02:02.840
<b>Pandemonium</b>

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:11.750
<i>It is where former angels, 
fallen from Heaven, work.</i>

00:02:12.170 --> 00:02:18.110
<i>With Satan gone, lords there work hard
 every day to keep things going.</i>

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:26.630
<i>Its noble and cold ruler, once a seraph,
 is the demon Beelzebub.</i>

00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:31.310
What?!

00:02:31.310 --> 00:02:33.210
We have an important meeting!

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:35.920
Her Excellency, Beelzebub, isn't here?!

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:11.920
