00:17:25.830 --> 00:17:26.560
Right.

00:17:26.710 --> 00:17:30.070
<b>Freudian slip</b>

00:17:28.130 --> 00:17:30.070
Hey, you okay?

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:34.480
<i>If something happened to Her Highness 
in a bad place like this...</i>

00:17:35.100 --> 00:17:36.280
<i>Calm down.</i>

00:17:36.280 --> 00:17:37.900
<i>Her Highness is the strongest there is.</i>

00:17:37.900 --> 00:17:40.530
<i>Even if she gets attacked by thugs,
 she won't be in danger.</i>

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:43.060
Lady, what are you doing around here?

00:17:43.060 --> 00:17:45.070
How about we show you around?

00:17:45.070 --> 00:17:46.110
<i>Calm down.</i>

00:17:49.910 --> 00:17:51.460
Knocked them right out.

00:17:51.700 --> 00:17:53.390
B-Bastard!

00:17:53.390 --> 00:17:55.320
You'll regret this!

00:17:56.480 --> 00:17:57.460
Mullin?

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:02.710
Mullin, are you hurt?

00:18:03.540 --> 00:18:04.480
How about you?

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:06.970
I'm fine.

00:18:08.620 --> 00:18:10.290
I'm sorry, Mullin.

00:18:10.290 --> 00:18:13.780
But you don't have to worry 
so much about me. I—

00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:19.340
No matter what...

00:18:22.380 --> 00:18:24.200
I'd worry!

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:40.860
I understand.

00:18:53.660 --> 00:18:55.270
Um, Your Highness...

00:18:55.270 --> 00:18:58.320
Before you sleep, I'd like to 
go over the schedule for tomorrow—

00:18:58.320 --> 00:18:59.430
I'm tired.

00:18:59.430 --> 00:19:01.430
Please leave.

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:06.740
<b>Uh oh...</b>

00:19:06.970 --> 00:19:07.820
Your Highness!

00:19:07.820 --> 00:19:10.230
I'm sorry, I said too much!

00:19:10.230 --> 00:19:13.210
Please open up!

00:19:23.020 --> 00:19:24.660
No matter what...

00:19:25.400 --> 00:19:27.430
I'd worry!

00:19:38.730 --> 00:19:40.720
That made my heart race.

00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:44.640
<i>The Ruler of Hell, Beelzebub,</i>

00:19:44.640 --> 00:19:48.000
<i>surprisingly, doesn't know how 
to handle the opposite sex.</i>

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:53.290
Oh, no.

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:55.090
I might get fired...

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:10.630
<i>This story might be one about how</i>

00:20:10.630 --> 00:20:15.030
<i>she finds the word 
for what she's feeling.</i>

00:22:00.110 --> 00:22:01.350
Where am I?

00:22:09.050 --> 00:22:10.410
There it is.

00:22:11.200 --> 00:22:12.990
I'm going to eat it today.

00:22:14.540 --> 00:22:15.310
There we go!

00:22:42.570 --> 00:22:43.810
Fluffy...

00:22:44.430 --> 00:22:45.460
Fluffy!

00:22:45.900 --> 00:22:47.450
Fluffy!

00:23:11.710 --> 00:23:13.500
That surprised me.

00:23:21.230 --> 00:23:22.550
So warm...

00:23:28.320 --> 00:23:30.040
Good night.

00:23:31.140 --> 00:23:33.310
Fluffy!

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:40.440
<b>Brother Tastes Like a Fairy Tale.</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:40.440
<b>She's Here, Vibration Girl.</b>

00:23:35.860 --> 00:23:37.870
Please watch next time.
